## Author: pfQuest SmartArrow contributors
## Notes: Turns pfQuest's arrow into a route-aware one: real zone passes, your flight paths, boats and zeppelins, paths around obstacles, along walked roads and away from hostile camps, drawn on the map. Requires pfQuest (brues-code or lightblade; ClassicAPI optional).
